"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/zipball/v2.3.0","body":"### Features\n\n* **api:** add Claude Tag endpoints for Claude Enterprise organizations\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **google-cloud:** send user profiles requests to the organization endpoint\n\n\n### Chores\n\n* **client:** stop sending query params hardcoded in endpoint paths\n* **docs:** improve the descriptions of the code execution tool and its encrypted results\n* **docs:** reword work queue, skill and external key descriptions\n* **docs:** update descriptions of the per-user usage and cost reports\n* **internal:** carry endpoint path query params to the request layer\n* **internal:** check the repository by owner and public name in workflows\n* **internal:** read the beta route qualifier instead of the beta=true query\n* **internal:** remove preview build upload from CI\n* **internal:** stop sending the beta query param from parse and stream\n\n\n### Documentation\n\n* **mcp:** remove the stray `await` from the async `tool_runner` examples\n* **google-cloud:** update the product name\n* **client:** link the Bedrock and Vertex raw response docstrings to the SDK documentation\n* update the README and the example request"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/421857674","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/421857674/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/421857674/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/tag/v2.2.0","id":421857674,"author":{"login":"anthropic-sdks-releaser[bot]","id":336223496,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFApdCA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76263028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/anthropic-sdks-releaser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOIy2NGM4ZJQmK","tag_name":"v2.2.0","target_commitish":"main","name":"v2.2.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-23T13:08:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:10:10Z","published_at":"2026-10-23T13:10:10Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/tarball/v2.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/zipball/v2.2.0","body":"### Features\n\n* **api:** add support for message threads\n* **api:** add usage and cost reports by dimension, mark older reports legacy\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **client:** stop suggesting math.inf in the max_retries error message\n* **tools:** leave the tool runner's history to the caller after `append_messages()`, and keep the current reply out of the `set_messages_params()` callback\n* **tools:** keep running the tool runner's function tools when `set_messages_params()` gives `tools` as definitions, and stop running one it takes out of `tools`\n* **tools:** give the `set_messages_params()` callback of a tool runner its `tools` as definitions again\n* **tools:** keep a tool runner's `betas`, `user_profile_id` and `workspace_id` when `set_messages_params()` leaves them out\n\n\n### Chores\n\n* **deps:** bump certifi in the dev lockfile\n* **docs:** clarify plugin content scan and validation descriptions\n* **docs:** clarify plugin served_version_pinned and updated_at\n* **docs:** fix usage and cost report examples and ending_at docs\n* **docs:** rate limit model lists vary by organization and workspace"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/420098160","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/420098160/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/420098160/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/tag/v2.1.0","id":420098160,"author":{"login":"anthropic-sdks-releaser[bot]","id":336223496,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFApdCA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76263028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/anthropic-sdks-releaser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/received_events