cloud:** use the v1 endpoints and add the organization endpoint\n\n\n### Chores\n\n* **ci:** skip the changelog check on draft pull requests\n* **docs:** add credential expiry descriptions to the Managed Agents API reference\n* **docs:** add Messages API request descriptions\n* **docs:** correct plugin manifest_version and reach descriptions\n* **docs:** improve Managed Agents memory store descriptions\n* **docs:** improve Managed Agents vault and credential descriptions"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/414206626","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/414206626/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/414206626/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/tag/v1.15.0","id":414206626,"author":{"login":"anthropic-sdks-releaser[bot]","id":336223496,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFApdCA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76263028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/anthropic-sdks-releaser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anth