telemetry/sdk).\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **api:** rename telemetry destination test response model\n* **client:** close dropped streams without waiting for the collector\n* **streaming:** pass unknown event types through the message stream helpers\n* **streaming:** stop raising \"Unexpected event order\" for an event before message_start\n\n\n### Chores\n\n* **docs:** correct prefill, thinking, fallback and model descriptions\n* **docs:** document the scope required to assign the managed role\n* **docs:** update model examples\n* **internal:** narrow the tripwire test rule in the contributor guides\n\n\n### Documentation\n\n* **api:** clarify when custom tool results can be sent\n* **api:** say is_enabled is always true for user spend limits"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/408050286","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/408050286/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/408050286/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/tag/v1.13.0","id":408050286,"author":{"login":"anthropic-sdks-releaser[bot]","id":336223496,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOFApdCA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76263028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/anthropic-sdks-releaser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anthropic-sdks-releaser%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/us